# wit-bindgen-core 0.57.1

Low-level support for bindings generation based on WIT files for use with
`wit-bindgen-cli` and other languages.

- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/wit-bindgen-core/0.57.1
- Repository: https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wit-bindgen
- Homepage: https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wit-bindgen
- Documentation: https://docs.rs/wit-bindgen-core/0.57.1
- License: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT

The package as published on crates.io carries no README. incan.pub wrote this one when it adopted the package as the Loaf `crates-io/wit-bindgen-core`.
